[
  {
    "version": "0.1",
    "section": 1,
    "moments": [
      {
        "narration": "今天我们来认识“面积”。到底什么是面积呢？简单来说，面积就是用边长为1个单位的正方形，把一个平面区域铺满后，所需要的正方形总数。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "note",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "title": "面积的意义",
              "items": [
                "面积表示物体表面或平面图形的大小",
                "测量方法：用标准单位正方形进行覆盖与计量"
              ]
            },
            "role": "explanation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "new_region"
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "note",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "title": "板书：面积与单位正方形",
              "items": [
                "单位正方形：测量面积的标准基准",
                "铺满法：用正方形覆盖平面区域",
                "总个数 = 图形的面积数值"
              ]
            },
            "reusable_item": 1,
            "role": "explanation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 1,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "intent": "引入面积的概念定义",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 1,
                "item": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "请看图示：我们先设定一个边长为1厘米的单位正方形，它的面积就是1平方厘米。接着，用这样的标准正方形去一步步铺满整个目标长方形区域。",
        "delivery": "encouraging",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "visual",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "capability": "process_diagram",
              "parameters": {
                "title": "单位正方形铺满过程",
                "steps": [
                  "确定标准：1个边长1cm的单位正方形",
                  "行与列排布：将正方形按行按列铺设",
                  "完全覆盖：无缝隙、不重叠地填满区域",
                  "统计总数：正方形个数即为总面积"
                ]
              }
            },
            "role": "main_visual",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "new_region"
            },
            "reusable_item": 2
          },
          {
            "action": "point_at",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "reference": {
              "source": "local_board_item",
              "moment": 2,
              "item": 1
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "animate",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "number": 1,
            "end_value": 5,
            "duration_intent": "normal",
            "easing": "linear"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "无论图形形状如何变化，只要数一数铺满这个区域一共用了多少个单位正方形，就能准确知道这个区域的面积大小了。",
        "delivery": "emphatic",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "after_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "1\\text{ cm}^2 = 1\\text{ cm} \\times 1\\text{ cm}"
            },
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 2,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "version": "0.1",
    "section": 2,
    "moments": [
      {
        "narration": "我们用边长为 1 厘米的单位正方形来铺满这个长方形。请注意观察它的排列方式。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "visual",
            "timing": "before_speech",
            "content": {
              "capability": "geometric_rearrangement",
              "parameters": {
                "title": "网格铺满法示意",
                "construction": "triangle_to_rectangle",
                "leg_a": 5,
                "leg_b": 3
              },
              "numbers": [
                1
              ]
            },
            "role": "main_visual",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "new_region"
            },
            "reusable_item": 2
          },
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "intent": "引导观察正方形网格在长方形内的完整排列",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 1,
                "item": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "我们可以看到，沿横向看，每一行排了 5 个小方格，这正好对应长方形的长为 5 厘米。",
        "delivery": "neutral",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "point_at",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "reference": {
              "source": "local_board_item",
              "moment": 1,
              "item": 1
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "沿纵向看，一共有 3 行小方格，这正好对应长方形的宽为 3 厘米。",
        "delivery": "neutral",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "point_at",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "reference": {
              "source": "local_board_item",
              "moment": 1,
              "item": 1
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "因为每行有 5 个方格，一共有 3 行，所以小方格的总数就是每行的个数乘以行数，即 5 乘以 3 等于 15 个。",
        "delivery": "encouraging",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "5 \\times 3 = 15"
            },
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 1,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "\\text{小方格总数} = \\text{每行个数} \\times \\text{行数}"
            },
            "reusable_item": 1,
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 4,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "由于每个小方格的面积是 1 平方厘米，15 个小方格的总面积就是 15 平方厘米。",
        "delivery": "emphatic",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "timing": "after_speech",
            "intent": "建立方格总数与图形总面积的直观对应",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 1,
                "item": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "version": "0.1",
    "section": 3,
    "moments": [
      {
        "narration": "我们知道，每行的方格数正好等于长方形的长，而行数正好等于宽。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "intent": "引导观察长方形的长、宽与每行方格数及行数的对应关系",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 2,
                "item": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "因为单位正方形的总数等于每行个数乘以行数，所以长方形的面积就等于长乘以宽。",
        "delivery": "emphatic",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "\\text{长方形面积} = \\text{长} \\times \\text{宽}"
            },
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 2,
                "item": 2
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "S = a \\times b = 5\\text{ cm} \\times 3\\text{ cm} = 15\\text{ cm}^2"
            },
            "reusable_item": 1,
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 2,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "point_at",
            "timing": "after_speech",
            "reference": {
              "source": "reusable",
              "section": 2,
              "item": 2
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "当长和宽的单位是厘米时，计算出的面积单位就是平方厘米，记作 cm²。现在请动手尝试将长调整为 6 cm，宽调整为 4 cm。",
        "delivery": "encouraging",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "animate",
            "timing": "after_speech",
            "number": 1,
            "end_value": 6,
            "duration_intent": "normal",
            "easing": "linear"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "student_activities": [
      {
        "kind": "number_target",
        "prompt": "请调整长和宽滑块，将长设置为 6 cm，宽设置为 4 cm。",
        "hints": [
          "拖动长滑块到 6 cm",
          "拖动宽滑块到 4 cm"
        ],
        "success_message": "太棒了！此时长方形包含了 6×4=24 个 1 cm² 的正方形，面积为 24 cm²。",
        "hint_after_attempts": 2,
        "number_controls": [
          {
            "number": 1,
            "controls": [
              "slider"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "value": 5.995,
        "tolerance": 0.0225
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "version": "0.1",
    "section": 4,
    "moments": [
      {
        "narration": "现在我们来深入区分周长与面积。请看这个长5厘米、宽3厘米的长方形。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "visual",
            "timing": "before_speech",
            "content": {
              "capability": "geometric_rearrangement",
              "parameters": {
                "title": "长方形周长与面积对比",
                "construction": "right_triangle_square",
                "leg_a": 5,
                "leg_b": 3
              },
              "numbers": [
                1
              ]
            },
            "role": "comparison_visual",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "right_of",
              "reference": {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 3,
                "item": 1
              }
            },
            "reusable_item": 2,
            "distinct_visual": true
          },
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "intent": "观察长方形的周长与面积展示",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 1,
                "item": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "周长是指围成图形一周的边缘总长度，就像绕着边界走一圈，算式是（5加3）乘以2等于16厘米。",
        "delivery": "emphatic",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "note",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "title": "周长与面积的根本区别",
              "items": [
                "周长：封闭图形一周的边缘长度（单位：cm）",
                "面积：图形内部占据平面的大小（单位：cm²）"
              ]
            },
            "reusable_item": 1,
            "role": "explanation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 1,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "而面积则是指内部覆盖的平面大小，也就是用单位正方形填满的区域，算式是5乘以3等于15平方厘米。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "C = (5 + 3) \\times 2 = 16\\text{ cm}"
            },
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 2,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "after_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "S = 5 \\times 3 = 15\\text{ cm}^2"
            },
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 3,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "切记，周长测量的是一条线段的长度，单位用厘米；面积测量的是平面的大小，单位用平方厘米。二者在概念、计算方式和单位上都完全不同！",
        "delivery": "careful",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "point_at",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "reference": {
              "source": "local_board_item",
              "moment": 1,
              "item": 1
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
